--!strict
-- Beach Cove arena assembly. Generated by emit_studio_script.py; edit that,
-- not this file.
--
-- Setup:
--   1. Import the 25 FBX files from exports/fbx at scale 1.0.
--   2. Put the resulting MeshParts in ServerStorage.BeachCoveKit, named as
--      below (01_Headland_Short, 02_Headland_Medium, ...).
--   3. Run this once. It builds Workspace.BeachCoveArena and is idempotent:
--      an existing arena is removed first.
--
-- Clear floor: 125 studs across, inside wall to inside wall.
--
-- Cliffs are scenery. Collision comes from the invisible BoundaryWall ring, as
-- MODULAR_CLIFF_KIT.md asks, because the visual meshes contain overlapping and
-- disconnected shells that make poor colliders.

